---
source: crates/observed_macros_impl/tests/expansion.rs
expression: output
---
---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten(x)] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` is a marker and does not accept arguments or a value

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten = "x"] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` is a marker and does not accept arguments or a value

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten] #[flatten] f: T }

---- yields ----
duplicate `#[flatten]` attribute

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten] #[dimension] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` cannot be combined with `#[dimension]`, `#[unredacted]`, `#[data_class]` or `#[if_none]`; the `observed::VisitFields` implementation of the value routes and redacts each of its fields

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten] #[unredacted] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` cannot be combined with `#[dimension]`, `#[unredacted]`, `#[data_class]` or `#[if_none]`; the `observed::VisitFields` implementation of the value routes and redacts each of its fields

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten] #[data_class(Euii)] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` cannot be combined with `#[dimension]`, `#[unredacted]`, `#[data_class]` or `#[if_none]`; the `observed::VisitFields` implementation of the value routes and redacts each of its fields

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
struct Subject { #[flatten] #[if_none(drop)] f: Option<T> }

---- yields ----
`#[flatten]` cannot be combined with `#[dimension]`, `#[unredacted]`, `#[data_class]` or `#[if_none]`; the `observed::VisitFields` implementation of the value routes and redacts each of its fields

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[counter(f)] struct Subject { #[flatten] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[counter(f)]` cannot record field `f`: a `#[flatten]` field holds fields, not a measurement

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info("{f}")] struct Subject { #[flatten] f: T }

---- yields ----
log message references `{f}` but no log attribute with that name exists; available attributes: []
